  'Look for Import font / Add font in the text panel. Prefer editors that accept .ttf/.otf from Files. If Chao tone letters still box, the active face is not Noto Sans — switch fonts and re-paste.': { tl: 'Look for Import font / Add font in the text panel. Prefer editors that accept .ttf/.otf from Files. If Chao tone letters still box, the active face is not Noto Sans — switch fonts and re-paste.', es: 'Look for Import font / Add font in the text panel. Prefer editors that accept .ttf/.otf from Files. If Chao tone letters still box, the active face is not Noto Sans — switch fonts and re-paste.', vi: 'Look for Import font / Add font in the text panel. Prefer editors that accept .ttf/.otf from Files. If Chao tone letters still box, the active face is not Noto Sans — switch fonts and re-paste.', wuu: '喺文字面板搵「匯入字體／新增字體」。優先用可從檔案讀 .ttf／.otf 嘅軟件。若調號仲係方格，代表而家唔係 Noto Sans——換字體再貼一次。', sichuan: '喺文字面板搵「匯入字體／新增字體」。優先用可從檔案讀 .ttf／.otf 嘅軟件。若調號仲係方格，代表而家唔係 Noto Sans——換字體再貼一次。' },
  'Look for the Jyutping copy control (different icon from plain Han copy). On Free, it opens Family upgrade.': { tl: 'Look for the Jyutping copy control (different icon from plain Han copy). On Free, it opens Family upgrade.', es: 'Look for the Jyutping copy control (different icon from plain Han copy). On Free, it opens Family upgrade.', vi: 'Look for the Jyutping copy control (different icon from plain Han copy). On Free, it opens Family upgrade.', wuu: '搵粵拼複製掣（圖示同普通漢字複製唔同）。免費版會打開家庭版升級。', sichuan: '搵粵拼複製掣（圖示同普通漢字複製唔同）。免費版會打開家庭版升級。' },
