  'Noto Sans HK does not include Chao tone letters (˥ ˨˩). If captions only use HK, ˥ ˨˩ often fall back to tofu boxes or the wrong face. Install Noto Sans for romanization + tones, and Noto Sans HK for 漢字.': { tl: 'Noto Sans HK does not include Chao tone letters (˥ ˨˩). If captions only use HK, ˥ ˨˩ often fall back to tofu boxes or the wrong face. Install Noto Sans for romanization + tones, and Noto Sans HK for 漢字.', es: 'Noto Sans HK does not include Chao tone letters (˥ ˨˩). If captions only use HK, ˥ ˨˩ often fall back to tofu boxes or the wrong face. Install Noto Sans for romanization + tones, and Noto Sans HK for 漢字.', vi: 'Noto Sans HK does not include Chao tone letters (˥ ˨˩). If captions only use HK, ˥ ˨˩ often fall back to tofu boxes or the wrong face. Install Noto Sans for romanization + tones, and Noto Sans HK for 漢字.', wuu: 'Noto Sans HK 唔包趙元任調號（˥ ˨˩）。字幕淨用 HK 時，˥ ˨˩ 好多時會變方格或者跳錯字體。粵拼＋趙元任調號用 Noto Sans，漢字用 Noto Sans HK。', sichuan: 'Noto Sans HK 唔包趙元任調號（˥ ˨˩）。字幕淨用 HK 時，˥ ˨˩ 好多時會變方格或者跳錯字體。粵拼＋趙元任調號用 Noto Sans，漢字用 Noto Sans HK。' },
