  'Use both. HK covers Hong Kong Chinese characters; Noto Sans carries Latin letters and Jyutping + Chao tone letters (˥ ˧˥ ˧ ˨˩ ˩˧ ˨).': { tl: 'Use both. HK covers Hong Kong Chinese characters; Noto Sans carries Latin letters and Jyutping + Chao tone letters (˥ ˧˥ ˧ ˨˩ ˩˧ ˨).', es: 'Use both. HK covers Hong Kong Chinese characters; Noto Sans carries Latin letters and Jyutping + Chao tone letters (˥ ˧˥ ˧ ˨˩ ˩˧ ˨).', vi: 'Use both. HK covers Hong Kong Chinese characters; Noto Sans carries Latin letters and Jyutping + Chao tone letters (˥ ˧˥ ˧ ˨˩ ˩˧ ˨).', wuu: '兩款都要用。HK 負責香港漢字；Noto Sans 負責拉丁字母同粵拼＋趙元任調號（˥ ˧˥ ˧ ˨˩ ˩˧ ˨）。', sichuan: '兩款都要用。HK 負責香港漢字；Noto Sans 負責拉丁字母同粵拼＋趙元任調號（˥ ˧˥ ˧ ˨˩ ˩˧ ˨）。' },
